1
00:00:00,240 --> 00:00:08,880
Dialog slavi svoj prvi rođen, i zato smo odlučili pitati naše male slušatelje što oni uopće znaju o logopediji, zašto idu kod logopeda i što tamo rade.

2
00:00:09,040 --> 00:00:10,560
Pa poslušajte što su nam rekli.

3
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:11,680
Spremna?

4
00:00:12,800 --> 00:00:13,040
Jesi.

5
00:00:13,360 --> 00:00:14,640
Tri, četiri.

6
00:00:15,520 --> 00:00:15,920
Sansa.

7
00:00:16,960 --> 00:00:18,320
Jel ti znaš ko sam ja?

8
00:00:19,280 --> 00:00:19,600
Laura.

9
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:20,560
Laura, da.

10
00:00:21,280 --> 00:00:23,760
Ja sam tvoj logo.

11
00:00:25,040 --> 00:00:25,520
Logo pet.

12
00:00:26,320 --> 00:00:27,760
Jesi se udobno smjestio?

13
00:00:27,920 --> 00:00:28,000
Da.

14
00:00:28,720 --> 00:00:29,120
Kako si?

15
00:00:29,600 --> 00:00:29,920
Dobro.

16
00:00:30,400 --> 00:00:31,200
Gdje si danas bio?

17
00:00:32,720 --> 00:00:33,360
U skoli.

18
00:00:34,960 --> 00:00:37,520
Pa bio sam u skoli i sad sam kod tebe.

19
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:38,480
Odlično.

20
00:00:39,520 --> 00:00:40,480
Mogu te pitati nešto?

21
00:00:41,680 --> 00:00:42,240
A kaj god?

22
00:00:43,280 --> 00:00:44,000
Kaj god hoću?

23
00:00:44,240 --> 00:00:44,320
Da.

24
00:00:44,800 --> 00:00:46,720
Recite meni, tko je logoped?

25
00:00:48,880 --> 00:00:51,840
Oni koji uče djecu razgovarati.

26
00:00:52,640 --> 00:01:01,280
Logoped je jedna teta koja pomaže djeci da dobro izgovaraju.

27
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:10,560
Logoped je jedna teta koja nam pomaže čitati, progovoriti slova i progovoriti pisanje.

28
00:01:11,200 --> 00:01:15,600
Pa logoped je osoba koja radi s djecom.

29
00:01:16,400 --> 00:01:21,040
I, evo, pomaže djeci da bolje razmišljaju.

30
00:01:21,600 --> 00:01:28,480
To tijekom te uči, pa neka sladaj to je šepe, e, a, sve.

31
00:01:28,880 --> 00:01:29,760
Tko je logoped?

32
00:01:30,480 --> 00:01:31,200
Teta toja.

33
00:01:31,600 --> 00:01:33,280
Ajde, ti meni reci, što ti misliš?

34
00:01:33,520 --> 00:01:34,240
Tko je logoped?

35
00:01:35,120 --> 00:01:35,200
Ti.

36
00:01:36,080 --> 00:01:37,440
Ja, dobro, a što ja radim?

37
00:01:38,240 --> 00:01:38,560
Kutic.

38
00:01:39,360 --> 00:01:39,840
Što učim?

39
00:01:41,360 --> 00:01:43,520
Mhm, a koga ja učim slova?

40
00:01:44,720 --> 00:01:45,040
Ljubav.

41
00:01:45,520 --> 00:01:46,640
Tko bi bio logoped?

42
00:01:47,680 --> 00:01:47,760
Ti.

43
00:01:48,320 --> 00:01:50,560
Ja, dobro, a što radim, logoped?

44
00:01:53,680 --> 00:01:54,640
Što radi logoped?

45
00:01:57,520 --> 00:01:59,520
Učava djecu slova.

46
00:02:00,320 --> 00:02:01,040
Samo slova?

47
00:02:01,600 --> 00:02:01,680
Da.

48
00:02:02,480 --> 00:02:03,840
Mhm, i što ja radim?

49
00:02:04,400 --> 00:02:05,200
Pomažeš mi.

50
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:07,200
Kako ja tebi pomažem?

51
00:02:07,920 --> 00:02:08,400
Čitati.

52
00:02:08,960 --> 00:02:10,480
Mhm, pomažem ti čitati.

53
00:02:10,640 --> 00:02:11,920
Šta još radimo skupa?

54
00:02:12,080 --> 00:02:12,480
Pisati.

55
00:02:12,960 --> 00:02:13,360
Pisati.

56
00:02:14,480 --> 00:02:15,680
Pisati matematiku.

57
00:02:15,920 --> 00:02:17,120
A i matematiku.

58
00:02:17,760 --> 00:02:19,760
Znači, učimo pisati, čitati.

59
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:20,400
Šta još?

60
00:02:21,280 --> 00:02:23,680
Učiti djecu kako da kako da mogu slova.

61
00:02:24,000 --> 00:02:25,280
Mhm, a šta bi se čuli?

62
00:02:25,440 --> 00:02:26,240
Radimo još nešto.

63
00:02:28,000 --> 00:02:28,720
Da?

64
00:02:35,680 --> 00:02:36,320
Cetinu.

65
00:02:36,960 --> 00:02:38,720
Šta si ti naučio kod logopeda?

66
00:02:40,240 --> 00:02:43,840
Naučio sam kod logopeda kako adekvate smiriti.

67
00:02:44,560 --> 00:02:47,040
Kako ti logoped još može pomoći?

68
00:02:47,680 --> 00:02:52,640
Može nekom drugom pomoći za neke druge stvari, možda netko ko nema adekvate?

69
00:02:54,560 --> 00:03:07,920
Onome što se loše ponaša, ko ima teško u školi, a kad si rekao nekome kome ide loše u školi, šta njemu to ne ide, pa da mu logoped može pomoći?

70
00:03:08,320 --> 00:03:10,640
Čitanje, pisanje, uredno.

71
00:03:11,520 --> 00:03:12,720
što sam ja došao, zapravo.

72
00:03:13,280 --> 00:03:14,640
Aha, zato si ti došao.

73
00:03:14,960 --> 00:03:16,880
Je li još nešto može raditi, logoped?

74
00:03:17,520 --> 00:03:17,600
Ne.

75
00:03:18,400 --> 00:03:21,120
Okej, a kako tebi, logoped, pomaže?

76
00:03:22,640 --> 00:03:23,920
Da me uči.

77
00:03:24,320 --> 00:03:26,240
Da, a što te je logoped naučio?

78
00:03:26,800 --> 00:03:28,000
Šta smo sve učile?

79
00:03:28,960 --> 00:03:30,320
Sve smo učile.

80
00:03:33,840 --> 00:03:34,240
Lutku.

81
00:03:35,120 --> 00:03:35,520
Lutku.

82
00:03:36,880 --> 00:03:38,720
Nisam joj sad još čekala.

83
00:03:39,040 --> 00:03:40,320
Što smo još radili, vidi?

84
00:03:40,960 --> 00:03:42,000
Po kaj se i voće.

85
00:03:42,720 --> 00:03:44,400
Voće i povrće.

86
00:03:44,800 --> 00:03:45,600
I povrće.

87
00:03:47,040 --> 00:03:48,720
Je li tebi, logoped, pomaže nešto?

88
00:03:52,240 --> 00:03:52,320
Je.

89
00:03:53,680 --> 00:03:55,520
Reći R ili reći L?

90
00:03:56,080 --> 00:03:56,160
Ne.

91
00:03:56,960 --> 00:03:58,000
L, tako je.

92
00:04:00,480 --> 00:04:01,920
Pa pomaže mi ovako.

93
00:04:02,720 --> 00:04:11,040
Kazuje neko soo, ja kažem Z, na primjer, Z, ja kažem, je bila još Z.

94
00:04:11,840 --> 00:04:13,760
A kako te je bilo, opet, pomaže?

95
00:04:14,080 --> 00:04:18,720
Pa meni pomaže kad nešto ne znam, pa onda dođem, naučim.

96
00:04:19,440 --> 00:04:21,280
I onda znam puno bolje u školi.

97
00:04:22,400 --> 00:04:25,040
I tako, volim dolaziti.

98
00:04:25,360 --> 00:04:26,560
Pa puno bolje citam.

99
00:04:26,560 --> 00:04:26,720
Znači, čitam.

100
00:04:28,160 --> 00:04:30,000
I puno bolje opisujem riječi.

101
00:04:30,240 --> 00:04:31,120
Ajde, bravo, super.

102
00:04:31,520 --> 00:04:33,040
Je li tebi logoped pomaže?

103
00:04:33,600 --> 00:04:33,920
Pa da.

104
00:04:34,480 --> 00:04:36,000
Kako ti pomaže, logoped?

105
00:04:36,720 --> 00:04:42,640
Kad je ružno, pa da uči boje pečata.

106
00:04:43,120 --> 00:04:46,000
I šta mi sve učimo, samo pričati ili još neke stvari?

107
00:04:47,200 --> 00:04:47,680
Čitati.

108
00:04:48,400 --> 00:04:48,800
Mhm.

109
00:04:55,120 --> 00:04:56,560
Svašta radimo, je li to?

110
00:04:56,880 --> 00:04:58,560
Svašta to je tvoja baca.

111
00:04:59,040 --> 00:05:01,600
Svašta to je tvoja mašta, daj penu.

112
00:05:02,000 --> 00:05:03,840
A što si ti naučio kod logopeda?

113
00:05:04,800 --> 00:05:05,280
Svašta.

114
00:05:05,600 --> 00:05:06,000
Svašta.

115
00:05:06,240 --> 00:05:06,720
Šta je to?

116
00:05:08,640 --> 00:05:10,400
Učio sam slovo le.

117
00:05:12,880 --> 00:05:15,520
Učio sam kako se koristi ta vuleta.

118
00:05:16,800 --> 00:05:17,040
Dobro.

119
00:05:17,920 --> 00:05:19,040
A šta sad učiš?

120
00:05:19,760 --> 00:05:20,320
Slovo le.

121
00:05:20,960 --> 00:05:23,280
Naučio sam pa rječica.

122
00:05:23,600 --> 00:05:26,640
Daj mi, recite, što ti najviše voliš raditi kod logopeda?

123
00:05:27,120 --> 00:05:28,240
Jako od zadaća.

124
00:05:29,120 --> 00:05:29,520
Stvarno.

125
00:05:29,760 --> 00:05:29,840
Da.

126
00:05:30,240 --> 00:05:31,920
Najviše voliš rječica.

127
00:05:32,240 --> 00:05:33,520
Ne voliš kad igramo igre?

128
00:05:34,400 --> 00:05:35,760
Voliš kad igramo igre.

129
00:05:36,320 --> 00:05:38,000
Šta ti draži igri ili zadaća?

130
00:05:38,560 --> 00:05:38,800
Igre.

131
00:05:39,360 --> 00:05:41,920
Na eto, vidiš da ima nešto bolje, je li tako?

132
00:05:42,320 --> 00:05:45,360
Da, kad smo vidjeli, ja sam se zabavio.

133
00:05:46,880 --> 00:05:51,040
Onda je slika pa ima pitanja.

134
00:05:51,680 --> 00:05:54,400
Pa onda gledamo sliku i onda zvučemo.

135
00:05:55,520 --> 00:05:56,400
To ti dobro ide.

136
00:05:57,760 --> 00:06:01,600
Znači, malo je slika po kričice.

137
00:06:02,000 --> 00:06:03,040
A, to ti se sviđa?

138
00:06:03,520 --> 00:06:03,600
Da.

139
00:06:04,160 --> 00:06:04,240
Super.

140
00:06:05,040 --> 00:06:08,720
A što je najbolja stvar koja ti se dogodila kod logopeda?

141
00:06:11,280 --> 00:06:12,080
Da si trolla.

142
00:06:12,640 --> 00:06:14,000
A, to ti je bila najbolja stvar.

143
00:06:14,240 --> 00:06:15,680
To te je najviše razveselilo.

144
00:06:15,680 --> 00:06:15,840
Da.

145
00:06:16,000 --> 00:06:18,320
Pa to mi je baš lijepo zaučut, baš mi je drago.

146
00:06:18,880 --> 00:06:19,520
Najbolja stvar.

147
00:06:19,840 --> 00:06:20,960
Da si trolla.

148
00:06:20,960 --> 00:06:21,440
A ako snimaš neko svećenje?

149
00:06:21,600 --> 00:06:23,040
Možda kad si bio mlađi, možda.

150
00:06:24,240 --> 00:06:31,840
Pa, bilo mi je super kad sam došao, ja sam se igrao s nečim, avutičima i takvim stvarima.

151
00:06:32,480 --> 00:06:33,600
Marko Gusarko.

152
00:06:34,000 --> 00:06:35,360
Zašto Marko Gusarko?

153
00:06:36,480 --> 00:06:42,080
Pa, zato što ima maslova i onda on isplodilo i da izvuče glavu.

154
00:06:42,480 --> 00:06:45,600
Aha, znači, ova igra, Marko Gusarko, ti je najbolja.

155
00:06:46,000 --> 00:06:50,560
Da izvuče glavu, to zvuči u more i pojednika morski psi.

156
00:06:53,200 --> 00:06:56,160
Kad bojaš, to voliš raditi.

157
00:06:56,400 --> 00:06:57,920
Da, u onoj.

158
00:06:58,800 --> 00:07:06,720
Sobim tim proma, onda sa slovima povrato, i onda tamo sam i našao šah.

159
00:07:07,280 --> 00:07:14,240
Tu je još bila teta Lucija, i onda mi se to dogodilo, našao šah.

160
00:07:14,960 --> 00:07:17,440
I onda sam igrao šah.

161
00:07:18,000 --> 00:07:22,560
Recci mi, je li ima neka super stvar koja ti se nekad dogodila kod logopeda?

162
00:07:23,280 --> 00:07:25,040
Ne, nikada ništa.

163
00:07:25,520 --> 00:07:25,760
Nikad.

164
00:07:26,160 --> 00:07:28,000
Ništa ti se lijepo nije dogodilo.

165
00:07:28,320 --> 00:07:28,640
A te?

166
00:07:29,200 --> 00:07:32,480
Pa meni se svaki put lijepo nešto dogodi kad mi ti dođeš.

167
00:07:33,520 --> 00:07:33,680
Kaj?

168
00:07:34,240 --> 00:07:36,880
Pa ja volim kad mi ti dođeš, onda budem jako sretna.

169
00:07:38,080 --> 00:07:38,400
A ti?

170
00:07:39,200 --> 00:07:39,760
Ja isto.

171
00:07:40,160 --> 00:07:43,040
Jesam li tebi nekad nešto lijepo dogodilo kod logopeda?

172
00:07:43,680 --> 00:07:43,760
Pa.

173
00:07:44,800 --> 00:07:46,000
Ili nešto smiješno?

174
00:07:48,080 --> 00:07:48,320
Nije.

175
00:07:49,120 --> 00:07:49,520
Nije baš.

176
00:07:50,640 --> 00:07:51,040
Pa nije.

177
00:07:52,320 --> 00:07:54,080
Jesmo se nekad zezali, ti i ja?

178
00:07:55,600 --> 00:08:05,600
Najbolje mi je kada imam vrijeme za odmor, onda mogu i rješavati labyrinte.

179
00:08:06,080 --> 00:08:08,160
Labyrinte ili kad odemo na WC?

180
00:08:09,680 --> 00:08:09,680
Da.

181
00:08:10,720 --> 00:08:11,920
I popit malo vode.

182
00:08:12,640 --> 00:08:14,720
Znači, kod logopeda ti je najbolji odmor.

183
00:08:15,200 --> 00:08:15,280
Da.

184
00:08:15,680 --> 00:08:16,480
Pa dobro, šta?

185
00:08:16,800 --> 00:08:19,920
Ne mogu ja tebi reći što je tebi najbolje, je li tako?

186
00:08:20,560 --> 00:08:20,640
Da.

187
00:08:20,880 --> 00:08:22,960
I kako ti se sviđa ovdje kod logopeda?

188
00:08:23,760 --> 00:08:23,840
Da.

189
00:08:24,320 --> 00:08:25,520
I što si sve naučio?

190
00:08:26,320 --> 00:08:27,120
Znam čitati.

191
00:08:27,680 --> 00:08:28,480
Znaš čitati?

192
00:08:28,960 --> 00:08:32,080
Iz čitanja sam dobio petice.

193
00:08:32,480 --> 00:08:32,800
Bravo.

194
00:08:33,120 --> 00:08:34,320
I ovo je više petice.

195
00:08:34,480 --> 00:08:36,160
I možeš sad više odrezati.

196
00:08:36,400 --> 00:08:37,680
Bravo, to je odlično.

197
00:08:38,160 --> 00:08:39,840
Jel ti voliš ići kod logopeda?

198
00:08:40,400 --> 00:08:40,480
Da.

199
00:08:41,520 --> 00:08:42,400
Što ti je najbolje?

200
00:08:42,960 --> 00:08:44,160
Peti i optice.

201
00:08:44,800 --> 00:08:46,480
Prati i loptice, u čemu?

202
00:08:47,040 --> 00:08:48,160
U periliću ljublja.

203
00:08:48,480 --> 00:08:50,800
U periliću rublja, periliću loptice.

204
00:08:54,480 --> 00:08:54,960
U čemu?

205
00:08:55,680 --> 00:08:56,640
Peremo loptice.

206
00:08:57,040 --> 00:08:57,280
Ajde.

207
00:08:57,680 --> 00:08:58,880
Iđu ljubija.

208
00:08:59,600 --> 00:09:00,640
U perilici rublja.

209
00:09:00,800 --> 00:09:02,480
Što još peremo u perilici rublja?

210
00:09:03,280 --> 00:09:04,960
Maje i čaja.

211
00:09:05,440 --> 00:09:05,920
Olično.

212
00:09:07,040 --> 00:09:11,600
A što ti misliš, kakva osoba mora biti logoped da bi bio dobar logoped?

213
00:09:12,240 --> 00:09:14,400
Što misliš, što on mora sve znati?

214
00:09:15,360 --> 00:09:20,640
Logoped ide u školu preko 200 mjeseca.

215
00:09:21,360 --> 00:09:22,880
Je preko 200 mjeseca da.

216
00:09:23,120 --> 00:09:25,040
Logoped ide u školu pet godina.

217
00:09:26,000 --> 00:09:26,960
Mislim da je to previše.

218
00:09:27,840 --> 00:09:27,920
Da.

219
00:09:28,320 --> 00:09:33,760
Misliš da bi logop logopedi trebali ići u školu?

220
00:09:34,160 --> 00:09:34,880
Šest mjeseci.

221
00:09:35,280 --> 00:09:36,480
Šest mjeseci, i to je to.

222
00:09:37,120 --> 00:09:39,920
Što ti misliš, kakva osoba treba biti logoped?

223
00:09:41,680 --> 00:09:42,320
Zaposlana.

224
00:09:42,720 --> 00:09:44,320
Zaposlana, to je istina.

225
00:09:45,280 --> 00:09:47,120
Kakva osoba treba biti logoped?

226
00:09:48,160 --> 00:09:50,400
Neko koja misli o djeci da su.

227
00:09:51,520 --> 00:09:52,640
koja žele pomoć.

228
00:09:53,280 --> 00:09:53,920
Mhm, super.

229
00:09:54,320 --> 00:09:55,680
Ko to ne radi za novce.

230
00:09:56,640 --> 00:09:58,560
Ok, možeš mi još nešto reći?

231
00:09:59,520 --> 00:10:00,160
Ristojan.

232
00:10:00,640 --> 00:10:01,520
Dobro, dalje.

233
00:10:02,240 --> 00:10:02,880
Ne psovat.

234
00:10:03,360 --> 00:10:04,640
Ne psovat, što još?

235
00:10:05,520 --> 00:10:08,640
Ne raditi gluposti, ne pametni.

236
00:10:10,240 --> 00:10:11,520
Dobro, ti si snadna.

237
00:10:12,000 --> 00:10:12,560
To je istina.

238
00:10:13,440 --> 00:10:14,080
I što još?

239
00:10:14,720 --> 00:10:15,360
Ili je to sve?

240
00:10:16,560 --> 00:10:16,880
Dobar.

241
00:10:17,440 --> 00:10:18,880
E, zanimljiv.

242
00:10:19,840 --> 00:10:20,320
Pametan.

243
00:10:20,720 --> 00:10:21,120
Mhm.

244
00:10:21,840 --> 00:10:24,480
Dobar, nježniji, ljubazniji.

245
00:10:24,800 --> 00:10:26,800
A, je smije ostaviti djecu samu?

246
00:10:27,760 --> 00:10:30,240
Ne, niti mu se kasnit.

247
00:10:30,720 --> 00:10:32,400
I ne može kasniti, tako je.

248
00:10:33,840 --> 00:10:34,880
Musi kreslo.

249
00:10:35,200 --> 00:10:35,440
Dobro.

250
00:10:35,680 --> 00:10:38,160
A kako oni trebaju biti ono dobri, zločesti?

251
00:10:39,200 --> 00:10:39,440
Dobri.

252
00:10:40,000 --> 00:10:41,040
Ok, kako još?

253
00:10:42,000 --> 00:10:43,840
Trebao bi biti zločest.

254
00:10:44,400 --> 00:10:46,400
Mamo je za sad.

255
00:10:46,800 --> 00:10:52,800
Pa kad djete bude izvozesta, tečko je li cura?

256
00:10:53,360 --> 00:10:53,840
Mhm.

257
00:10:54,160 --> 00:10:55,360
A kako oni trebaju biti?

258
00:10:57,200 --> 00:10:58,320
Lijepo bučeni.

259
00:10:59,520 --> 00:11:00,400
Lijepo bučeni.

260
00:11:00,880 --> 00:11:01,440
A još nešto?

261
00:11:04,080 --> 00:11:04,160
Ne.

262
00:11:04,640 --> 00:11:08,400
A kako izgleda logoped, kako bi ti opisao nekog logopeda?

263
00:11:08,800 --> 00:11:09,600
Koznanstvenik.

264
00:11:10,400 --> 00:11:11,120
Koznanstvenik?

265
00:11:11,360 --> 00:11:11,440
Da.

266
00:11:13,280 --> 00:11:20,240
Kad bi druge teče gledalo, logoped da misle da je snagstvenik u ukusu.

267
00:11:22,960 --> 00:11:24,400
Dobro, gledalo, logoped.

268
00:11:24,400 --> 00:11:27,200
Znači, ovako normalni radnik.

269
00:11:29,920 --> 00:11:32,400
Ovo je malo teško pitanje.

270
00:11:32,800 --> 00:11:33,760
Teško pitanje.

271
00:11:34,080 --> 00:11:35,520
Pa što sam iz škapa izgleda?

272
00:11:38,000 --> 00:11:40,160
Nekom ne blaga jednog.

273
00:11:40,480 --> 00:11:41,520
Dobro, okej.

274
00:11:42,240 --> 00:11:44,960
Sad s rdećim košom.

275
00:11:45,920 --> 00:11:46,800
Tamo je šmođu.

276
00:11:48,480 --> 00:11:49,840
Ima nešto tu.

277
00:11:50,640 --> 00:11:51,360
A rep ima.

278
00:11:54,160 --> 00:11:55,520
Sa crvenom majicom.

279
00:11:56,000 --> 00:11:57,680
Sa crvenom majicom, dobro.

280
00:11:58,160 --> 00:12:00,560
A možda ja nekad imam i neko drugo majico, olako?

281
00:12:01,040 --> 00:12:01,040
Da.

282
00:12:02,000 --> 00:12:03,760
A kako izgleda jedan logoped?

283
00:12:04,160 --> 00:12:05,680
Je to znaš objasniti?

284
00:12:06,160 --> 00:12:06,240
Ne.

285
00:12:06,880 --> 00:12:08,000
Kako izgleda jedan logoped?

286
00:12:08,240 --> 00:12:09,760
Bio si kod logopeda nekoliko.

287
00:12:10,720 --> 00:12:12,160
Gdje logoped nosi.

288
00:12:13,920 --> 00:12:14,400
Uniformu.

289
00:12:14,880 --> 00:12:17,120
Naha, ili ronilačko odijelo.

290
00:12:17,680 --> 00:12:18,160
Uniformu.

291
00:12:18,480 --> 00:12:18,800
Kakvu?

292
00:12:20,000 --> 00:12:20,320
Bijelu.

293
00:12:20,960 --> 00:12:22,880
Dobro, jesu li logopedi nosili bielu?

294
00:12:24,160 --> 00:12:24,240
Ne.

295
00:12:24,800 --> 00:12:25,040
Nego?

296
00:12:26,080 --> 00:12:29,280
Nego neki možda, a neki možda ne.

297
00:12:30,240 --> 00:12:35,920
Pa, ima obucu crnu, hoću u majicu.

298
00:12:36,960 --> 00:12:37,680
Žutu majicu.

299
00:12:38,480 --> 00:12:40,000
Ja nemam žutu majicu danas.

300
00:12:40,480 --> 00:12:41,120
A dukse?

301
00:12:41,840 --> 00:12:42,640
Nemam dukse.

302
00:12:43,200 --> 00:12:45,200
Ajde, ali vidio.

303
00:12:45,600 --> 00:12:47,120
Ti imaš dukse, ja nemam.

304
00:12:47,520 --> 00:12:48,720
Što ja imam obučeno?

305
00:12:50,240 --> 00:12:51,680
Logopetsku majicu.

306
00:12:52,080 --> 00:12:54,320
Logopetsku majicu, to ti se zove kuta.

307
00:12:54,720 --> 00:12:55,040
Kuta.

308
00:12:55,840 --> 00:12:57,600
Ja vidim kada se izmijem kutu.

309
00:12:58,240 --> 00:12:58,640
Naprimjer.

310
00:12:59,440 --> 00:13:03,120
Crnu, ali ovdje je onda bijela majica.

311
00:13:05,360 --> 00:13:06,400
Aha, crni sa ko.

312
00:13:07,360 --> 00:13:09,440
Aha, to je jako profesionalno.

313
00:13:11,120 --> 00:13:11,600
Kravata.

314
00:13:11,920 --> 00:13:13,280
I kravatu mora imati lobo.

315
00:13:13,680 --> 00:13:16,000
Aha, znači to je jako nešto profesionalno.

316
00:13:16,240 --> 00:13:17,600
Ali ja nemam sad kravatu.

317
00:13:17,840 --> 00:13:18,320
Neveš.

318
00:13:18,320 --> 00:13:18,480
Nemoveže.

319
00:13:18,640 --> 00:13:20,160
Neveze, ćeš mi oprostic?

320
00:13:20,720 --> 00:13:22,800
Okej, ti ovo imamo u udice.

321
00:13:24,160 --> 00:13:28,240
Nije baš jako profesionalna kao kravata, ali bar smo se lijepo uparili, jel da.

322
00:13:28,560 --> 00:13:29,440
Da, i golio.

323
00:13:29,760 --> 00:13:31,440
Imamo i žep na udici, da.

324
00:13:32,640 --> 00:13:33,760
Možeš još jedno pitanje?

325
00:13:34,800 --> 00:13:34,800
Ne.

326
00:13:35,680 --> 00:13:36,800
Ne, ajmo još jedno.

327
00:13:37,200 --> 00:13:37,280
Ok.

328
00:13:37,840 --> 00:13:41,920
Samo da mi ti kažes, šta misliš da ja radim kad nisam na poslu?

329
00:13:42,960 --> 00:13:44,960
Kad odem doma, šta misliš da ja radim?

330
00:13:47,040 --> 00:13:47,680
Igraš.

331
00:13:49,520 --> 00:13:50,480
Nekakvu igru.

332
00:13:51,040 --> 00:13:51,680
Igram igre.

333
00:13:53,040 --> 00:13:53,360
Pa baš.

334
00:13:54,160 --> 00:13:56,560
Šta ti misliš da radi logoperka dođe doma?.

335
00:13:57,280 --> 00:13:57,920
Odmara se.

336
00:13:58,880 --> 00:13:59,840
Kako se odmara?

337
00:14:00,320 --> 00:14:00,560
Pa ne.

338
00:14:01,040 --> 00:14:01,680
Samo spava.

339
00:14:04,640 --> 00:14:06,000
Ne printam doma ništa.

340
00:14:06,560 --> 00:14:07,520
Kako ti je?

341
00:14:07,920 --> 00:14:10,480
Pa ne znam, ti meni reci šta misliš da radim doma.

342
00:14:13,360 --> 00:14:14,480
Dobro pitanje.

343
00:14:15,840 --> 00:14:17,760
Ideš vječe sad?

344
00:14:19,280 --> 00:14:20,560
Jeddeš ručak.

345
00:14:21,680 --> 00:14:22,800
Dobro, još nešto.

346
00:14:23,600 --> 00:14:24,160
Samo jedem.

347
00:14:24,640 --> 00:14:25,360
Jedem i radim.

348
00:14:27,120 --> 00:14:27,600
Ispava.

349
00:14:29,520 --> 00:14:30,560
Pin je u mobitel.

350
00:14:31,360 --> 00:14:32,400
Pin je u mobitel.

351
00:14:34,720 --> 00:14:35,920
Dobro, i šta je još?

352
00:14:36,960 --> 00:14:43,200
Kuplju stvari za kuću, peče ih, grija, preživi zimu i te stvari.

353
00:14:43,760 --> 00:14:44,400
Ok, super.

354
00:14:46,560 --> 00:14:49,920
Jedno, ako su gladni, piju.

355
00:14:50,960 --> 00:14:55,280
I ute se na djecu, ako nešto skaje.

356
00:14:56,240 --> 00:15:00,240
Da doma peče pelocinke.

357
00:15:00,640 --> 00:15:01,680
Peče pelocinke.

358
00:15:02,640 --> 00:15:03,600
Dobro, što još?

359
00:15:04,640 --> 00:15:05,360
Ili je to to?

360
00:15:06,560 --> 00:15:07,040
To je to.

361
00:15:07,360 --> 00:15:07,680
Dobro.

362
00:15:08,000 --> 00:15:10,000
Jel bi ti nekad bio htio biti logoped?

363
00:15:10,320 --> 00:15:11,360
Ja bih bio policajac.

364
00:15:11,680 --> 00:15:12,800
Policajac želiš biti??

365
00:15:13,120 --> 00:15:14,160
Ne želiš biti logoped.

366
00:15:14,880 --> 00:15:15,360
Zašto ne?

367
00:15:15,680 --> 00:15:17,040
Ja ću proći školu.

368
00:15:17,440 --> 00:15:18,560
Proći ćeš, zašto ne?

369
00:15:18,720 --> 00:15:19,120
Ako se jako.

370
00:15:19,520 --> 00:15:20,800
Ja ću doći do politike.

371
00:15:20,960 --> 00:15:21,280
Ok, dobro.

372
00:15:21,680 --> 00:15:26,000
Ja ću doći do politike i dati čudovit odkaz.

373
00:15:26,640 --> 00:15:27,040
To je sve.

374
00:15:27,360 --> 00:15:27,440
Da.

375
00:15:27,760 --> 00:15:28,240
Petica.

376
00:15:28,800 --> 00:15:30,080
Si zaslužio bombon?

377
00:15:30,480 --> 00:15:30,480
Da.

378
00:15:31,200 --> 00:15:31,600
Bombi je.
